==German==

===Etymology===
Obviously a diminutive form pertaining to {{term|Knoblauch|lang=de}}. The ''-f-'' would be explicable if the form ''Knofi'' stemmed not from the standard German word directly, but from {{etym|nds-de|de}} (cf. {{etym|gml|-}} {{term|knoflōk|lang=gml}}).

